| stage | node | plan_|
+-+-+-+
| 0_| 0_|_CooperativeExec metrics=REDACTED_|
|_|_|_MergeScanExec: REDACTED
|_|_|_|
| 1_| 0_|_FilterExec: json_get(attrs@1, $.value, NULL) > 600, projection=[ts@0] metrics=REDACTED_|
|_|_|_CooperativeExec metrics=REDACTED_|
|_|_|_UnorderedScan: region=REDACTED, {"partition_count":{"count":2, "mem_ranges":0, "files":2, "file_ranges":2}, "projection": ["ts", "attrs"], "filters": ["json_get(attrs, Utf8(\"$.value\"), Int64(NULL)) > Int64(600)"], "files":REDACTED,"flat_format":REDACTED, "metrics_per_partition":REDACTED metrics=REDACTED |
|_|_|_|
|_|_| Total rows: REDACTED_|
+-+-+-+

